{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OB9VJXvKjn1795134923.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>山頂有男子墮下斜坡，清醒獲救。</p><p></p><p>事發後涉事男子登上救護車，接受初步治理。現場是山頂盧吉道，警方表示，昨晚近10時半接獲一名女子報案，指一名男子從欄杆墮下斜坡。現場消息指，該男子是南亞裔，懷疑當時飲醉酒。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:33:21.016055+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T19:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:37:12.743355+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:26:43.308864+00:00","content_hash":"ffe1ea8074f48c31f37a96a23ae8f18398d7bfee7dcd0c6a2bffe8245918d947","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:33:21.016055+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}